  Ported from js/analysis.js at commit b55d5b3f1e5162b41aa01aa29530e7d7fb4dceef: the audio
  feature extraction, onset peak picking, tempo detection (autocorrelation with a log-normal
  prior, circular-concentration phase fit, kick-gap octave test, whole-BPM snap), beat grid and
